{"synopsis":"9TaePyong, profesor operasi dengan masa depan yang menjanjikan terlahir kembali di desa pinggiran inggris pada abad 19 dengan membawa semua ingatan dari kehidupan pertamanya.\n\nDia sekali lagi memperdalam impiannya menjadi seorang dokter. Namun, dia ditampar dengan kenyataan yang berat dalam bidang medis di London, soalnya bahkan tidak ada yang namanya upaya sterilisasi dasar.\n\nDengan melalui diskriminasi yang diterima, TaePyong memperlihatkan kemampuan hebatnya sebagai dokter misterius dari timur.","alternative_title":"검은 머리 영국 의사","author":"Hansanleega, Lee Yoo Soo","artist":"OCHEN","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ee9317ed-81ec-4b35-ae0a-26c75143a0c0","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-01-14","released":"2026-01-14","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_50/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"0e54e3f7-d1ad-490b-8944-1259ea6fac52","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-01-13","released":"2026-01-13","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d1193644-ae95-4f67-89a6-08b2fc45b891/chapter_ch_49/1.webp","http